    {
      "id": "claim_fb69dd025a184af283a5a439061a1f49",
      "statement": "spawn_agent_worker launches the assigned specialist as a detached hermes -p <assignee> subprocess with stdin=DEVNULL and stderr=STDOUT merged into the worker log, pinning HERMES_HOME to the profile's home (spawn flags are --cli chat -q <prompt>, with --yolo --accept-hooks appended only when allow_unattended_approvals is enabled), then correlates the new session_id against the profile's state.db via resolve_profile_state_db.",
