    {
      "id": "claim_5bfad96eee7646e8953599b022c3a02c",
      "statement": "github_pr.py fetches PR review comments and formats them into task comments; ai_prefix(text, role) prepends a role-tagged [AI:<role>] marker (default zf-builder) to agent-authored GitHub text and is idempotent for any existing role-tagged [AI:<tag>] marker, so humans can distinguish agent output from human output.",
