      "id": "claim_e3c674af5f2d43fb91e623a9259bdfe7",
      "statement": "When a task carries external_issue metadata, the PR body opened by the dispatcher appends 'Fixes #<n>' for GitHub issues or 'Resolves: <KEY>' for Jira issues so merging the PR links the source issue.",
