      "statement": "All task status and assignee transitions funnel through transition_task in dispatcher/state_machine.py, which validates every move against the VALID_TRANSITIONS graph, raises InvalidStateTransitionError for illegal edges (non-human actors rejected from any edge outside the graph), and delegates canonical assignee resolution for a target status to resolve_status_assignee in paths.py so reaper, scheduler, and dashboard move_task agree on legal moves.",
