    {
      "id": "claim_45cf636664ea4b51ab5b0d3941c15223",
      "statement": "The per-board improvement scanner runs inside the dispatcher process: each dispatch cycle reaps dead scanner PIDs via reap_active_scanners and, when a board's active task count is below its cap, its todo count is below idle_scan_max_todo, no scanner is active for that board, and the get_scanner_cron_config cooldown has elapsed, spawns a background zf-orchestrator scan of the board's repositories via spawn_board_scanner; lifecycle helpers (get_active_scanner_pids, kill_board_scanner, reset_idle_scanner_state) live in dispatcher/scanner.py.",
